<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	 19.41    2.37</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman     14.21    0.95</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld     13.21    5.30</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	 12.45    2.41</p>
<p> 5   Multistack	     10.71    0.28</p>
<p> 6   Kurts (P) Prop	 10.49    1.43</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	10.42    0.98</p>
<p> 8   Prime Credit Tr	10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	  10.22    0.89</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	  10.01    1.63</p>
<p>11   Villa World	     9.80    1.02</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 9.80    1.08</p>
<p>13   Gem Property Tr	 9.73    1.44</p>
<p>14   Blackmores Lab	  9.41    3.40</p>
